{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd7a4cd1bf9231253ba852a9b72e0cfb9c882acd381e9ad0ad738a6328e50e6c", "ja": "（感謝祭前日。リハーサルの手応えは十分！\n細かい調整は当日やるとして、残すは本番だけ……）", "zh": "（感謝祭前一天。彩排的感觉非常好！细节调整留到当天再做，剩下的就只有正式演出了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "598fdaa836df56f03519217bf453f4eff8fe81148e800bb78841b169aabe8c59", "ja": "このみさん？　……お疲れ様です。\nこんなところで、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "好美？……辛苦了。怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "bfcdd79f159d0a145d2e01dfd8057a50a3ff9d5d99ceb2c955d65f8689b7c2c8", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nうん……ちょっと星が見たくなって。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n嗯……突然有点想看星星了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d59998dd13fc9c05674b6fde180d781b4e8602862257c53ba3793837b6ec39b", "ja": "『天体公演』も『STARDOM ROAD』も\n終わって、なんていうか達成感みたいなものはあるの。", "zh": "《天体公演》和《STARDOM ROAD》都结束了，怎么说呢，还是有种成就感之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "eb1610db78ef10c821b0cc8aee2b1bb00b96959ef88f88d5d17f706627879d22", "ja": "ゴールに着いて、嬉しい気持ちもあるんだけど……\n同じくらい寂しい気持ちもあって……。", "zh": "抵达终点，虽然会感到开心……\n却也同样会感到寂寞……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "0a1e2bdbddb1343bbf45e3112b49519746ad78655e18f9d23b346ad192d86400", "ja": "展示用に出した衣装とか、トークショーの準備で\n公演を見返してたら……いろいろ思い出しちゃった。", "zh": "看到拿去展览的演出服，还有准备脱口秀时\n重温以前的公演……就想起了好多事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8e3bf244b4644c436508aa078c0a02e072b8fbbe42716c90b952ec9a4484f88e", "ja": "このみさん……。", "zh": "木实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "36f5cc9c00efd2ebe2f66749bbefdacdaf8f09c2b00b12a0c4b2b2b02a35f61d", "ja": "本番で寂しがるわけにはいかないけど。\n今だけ。あと少しだけ、ここで……。", "zh": "正式演出时可不能感到寂寞，不过。\n就现在。再一会儿，就一会儿，在这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cfcd4750c8670549b814044ffa58dd00a394c5b322ecf0e0f146387db2b7fa2e", "ja": "はい。今夜はここで、好きなだけ……。そして明日は\n元気な姿を、ファンの人達に見せてあげてください。", "zh": "好的。今晚就在这里，想待多久就待多久……然后明天，请让粉丝们看到你精神饱满的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "8eab24a0ce7d81982ffa9731e098ed1b611668aec9ebfc5360a2ace12517766b", "ja": "……そうね。明日はステージもイベントも盛り沢山。\n休む暇なんてないくらい……くしゅん！", "zh": "……是啊。明天不仅有舞台表演，还有满满的活动。\n忙得连休息的时间都没有……阿嚏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e1127a210a285a30a9de7a297704c86962d8568aaf19f780cedaf4f2f2ea3a48", "ja": "あ。", "zh": "啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "315ffc69c78df5d37ee238027bbd75e5c92e93ae51d220b95a6fe03fb7e05f6d", "ja": "……あはは。もうちょっと居たかったけど、やめた方が\n良さそうね。風邪で不参加とか、シャレにならないわ。", "zh": "……啊哈哈。虽然还想再待一会儿，但还是早点回去比较好。要是因为感冒而无法参加，那可就不好笑了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "87377c39812f674def6e678dda4f9690b503f572684d9309cf14b5a57454fabf", "ja": "そうですね。ここで好きなだけって言いましたけど……\nすみません、やっぱり今すぐ戻ってください。", "zh": "是啊。我刚才说过要在这里待多久都行，不过……\n抱歉，还是请您现在马上回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "9385e73769d6009816cb2c33f8eabab45ced0441276dc630755a5f395493a068", "ja": "はーい。今夜は晩酌も控えめにして、\n早く寝ることにするわ。", "zh": "好——今晚我也会少喝点，早点睡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0553_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "b4758d89b06888d1b7e48fb0ac6cb1104955f99155625df7e5bba966e2661f07", "ja": "{$P$}。明日はみんなで、\n最高のフィナーレにしましょうね！", "zh": "{$P$}。明天大家一起，为这场演出画上最棒的句号吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
